&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;wlan0: Trying to associate with SSID &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;xxxxxxx&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
